speechtext:
Item agreed to.
Customs tariff-208b. Bisulphate of soda or nitre cake:	British preferential tariff, free;
intermediate tariff, 20 per cent; general tariff, 20 per cent.

Item agreed to.
Customs tariff-208h. Ethylene glycol, when imported by manufacturers of anti-freezing compounds to be used exclusively in the manufacture of anti-freezing compounds, in their own factories:	British preferential tariff, free;
intermediate tariff, 15 per cent; general tariff, 15 per cent.

Item agreed to.
Customs tariff-218. Acid phosphate, not medicinal:	British preferential tariff, free;
intermediate tariff, 25 per cent; general tariff, 25 per cent.
